What Determines Node Order in qs.py v1.1

Scanning Browser Tabs: When QuackSink opens or scans, it reads open Chromium browser tabs from left to right.

Populating self.nodes: As each node tab (ChatGPT/Luma, Claude, Gemini/Astra, DeepSeek/Kelp) is discovered, it is inserted into self.nodes.

